  "steps": [
    "Boil and mince 100g raw soy chunks, 1 tbsp ginger garlic paste, 1 tsp salt, 1 tbsp red chilli powder. Mix well and set it aside.",
    "Now dip 2 sheets (33g each) of rice paper in water for 10 seconds until it softens.",
    "Spread and divide whole portion of the soy mixture evenly over the rice papers.",
    "Roll it up tightly and cut it into 5-6 bite-sized pieces.",
